TranslationUnitDecl
|-CXXRecordDecl referenced struct T definition
| `-CXXConstructorDecl T 'void ()'
`-FunctionDecl s11 'void ()'
  `-CompoundStmt
    `-DeclStmt
      `-VarDecl g 'T (*)' callinit
        `-ImplicitCastExpr 'T (*)' <NullToPointer>
          `-CXXNullPtrLiteralExpr 'std::nullptr_t'
